content:
好的，这是一个功能完整的扫雷游戏。它包含了您要求的所有特性：左键翻开、右键插旗、剩余雷数显示、点空白自动展开（连开）以及重新开局按钮。

请直接将以下代码保存为 `.html` 文件，用浏览器打开即可运行。

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    >
    <title>经典扫雷</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #e6e9ef;
            --panel-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-color: #333;
            --mine-danger: #c0392b;
            --flag-color: #f39c12;
            --cell-size: 45px; /* 控制格子大小 */
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .game-container {
            background-color: var(--panel-bg);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding: 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .status-box {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .stat-item {
            background-color: #f0f0f0;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            min-width: 60px;
            cursor: pointer; /* 点击重置 */
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        .stat-item:hover {
            background-color: #ddd;
        }

        .stat-item span {
            display: block;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: var(--text-color);
        }

        .stat-item label {
            font-size: 0.7em;
            color: #777;
            display: block;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        button.reset-btn {
            background-color: var(--mine-danger);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }

        button.reset-btn:hover {
            background-color: #a93226;
        }

        .board {
            display: grid;
            gap: 2px;
            border: 2px solid #ccc;
            padding: 5px;
            background-color: #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .cell {
            width: var(--cell-size);
            height: var(--cell-size);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 1.5em;
            font-weight: bold;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
            position: relative;
            transition: all 0.1s ease;
            box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
        }

        /* Hover effects for unopened cells */
        .cell.unopened:hover {
            background-color: #d0d0d0;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        /* Opened cell styles */
        .cell.opened {
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: none;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            cursor: default;
        }

        .cell.number {
            color: #333;
        }

        /* Number colors (classic style) */
        .number[data-val="1"] { color: #27ae60; }
        .number[data-val="2"] { color: #2980b9; }
        .number[data-val="3"] { color: #8e44ad; }
        .number[data-val="4"] { color: #16a085; }
        .number[data-val="5"] { color: #d35400; }
        .number[data-val="6"] { color: #e74c3c; }
        .number[data-val="7"] { color: #333; }
        .number[data-val="8"] { color: #333; }
        .number[data-val="9"] { color: #27ae60; }

        /* Flagged cell */
        .cell.flagged {
            cursor: default;
        }
        .cell.flagged::after {
            content: "🚩";
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }

        /* Mine explosion */
        .cell.mine-exploded {
            background-color: #ffe0e0;
            color: #ff0000;
            animation: shake 0.3s;
        }

        @keyframes shake {
            0% { transform: translateX(0); }
            25% { transform: translateX(-5px); }
            50% { transform: translateX(5px); }
            75% { transform: translateX(-5px); }
            100% { transform: translateX(0); }
        }

        /* Overlay for Win/Lose */
